    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0105",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p097-03090-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In the end, we found empirical support for Lionel Trilling’s main thesis in his 1950 book The Liberal Imagination: “Literature is the human activity that takes the fullest and most precise account of variousness, possibilities, complexity, and difficulty.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "7c1caffb54cc0a8261dfd10cc0907a16b3e65dfe5f78ff5d33744bd60856d037",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p097-03090-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "f5c07ba3c9296058d194df9eea829e9b6ae168013cb54c12b1e37af1130d2385",
      "passageSha256": "c13642caf8f46e15cf324be4bc9b6efdffd1150888e2f9c73b3c96990888303a",
      "pdfPages": [
        97
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0106",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p097-04845-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I have repeatedly argued that a perspective change is a key to a psychologically rich experience, though so far I have not provided empirical evidence for this claim.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d20c5f2032c68b5d2f9a58b25b42687c8dd047f726457e8ce6cf0480eccb5f80",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p097-04845-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-056",
      "parentFingerprint": "0b1b20cd1d6d2d09044d2233184d599a978b5bce99f93ba5c86f84a4af7ed36e",
      "passageSha256": "ab338c944ab5c0fc70a157f35da9f03ce79722c7de55c8c4bd07ca9b5ac4d571",
      "pdfPages": [
        97
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0107",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Look at Noma Bar’s drawing of a skinny, tall glass filled with beer (Figure 2, above).",
      "sentenceSha256": "0fe641b5852303fb75cf84506b5e0ecf6fd767f88f66c17a3b14541ca37e7e24",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-057",
      "parentFingerprint": "af540728d5dd390561a6bebee1cae6d7d721cbaef913a35b29781851fcdcb95f",
      "passageSha256": "25cbb1e437f4b8c393d2ab2ea8683e3d3440d4ad3b60f9800c32b5807c3f8047",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0108",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The foam on top is shaped so that, when viewed a certain way, it looks like a face.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8eaca56a8e8bdec24f6597f590be532d1ef998cbe1e13a508c533337970917e6",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-057",
      "parentFingerprint": "af540728d5dd390561a6bebee1cae6d7d721cbaef913a35b29781851fcdcb95f",
      "passageSha256": "25cbb1e437f4b8c393d2ab2ea8683e3d3440d4ad3b60f9800c32b5807c3f8047",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0109",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In one experiment, we showed this image on screen and asked participants a question: “What do you see?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "5904e44f988f2ebd2e558d758d367ccff67723735f0fcb8de0c1101bb4c381ad",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-057",
      "parentFingerprint": "af540728d5dd390561a6bebee1cae6d7d721cbaef913a35b29781851fcdcb95f",
      "passageSha256": "25cbb1e437f4b8c393d2ab2ea8683e3d3440d4ad3b60f9800c32b5807c3f8047",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0110",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Depending on your perspective, you see beer or a face.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f9317e151f1061f1dee85fe906a77664ccd5a5c673279df8fe999425bfc49be6",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-04042-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "a413bc69fd5e29b3286a8d74de23c7f0a2613c2caf9b6a95763506fae585a148",
      "passageSha256": "0e638c1490e013a125e772ff866e6cb412b524e054d4371ee1e981644c5baf14",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0111",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Another group of participants saw an altered image of the beer glass (Figure 3).",
      "sentenceSha256": "d6b1c3f30b65ef911da926d9078c842097a4c6568bfd3bc35e5cf5c39b213196",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "13ba9cfbf44962fc0320ed4cdfaedf5bc8a339557d5ccee02c17701d09bdd8d3",
      "passageSha256": "5520749acde7c3fe55ce4a1cf160885e302b975085e1e56a465fc1a10279a49e",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0112",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-s003",
      "sentenceText": "That is, the altered image is just a glass filled with beer.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8a00b182173f6465c40247a3d3415709a8d74e7ec25ff627bdd0bf6d0bb42640",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "13ba9cfbf44962fc0320ed4cdfaedf5bc8a339557d5ccee02c17701d09bdd8d3",
      "passageSha256": "5520749acde7c3fe55ce4a1cf160885e302b975085e1e56a465fc1a10279a49e",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0113",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-s004",
      "sentenceText": "We asked the same two questions: “What do you see?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "e6b0b28c94f6df7e6911948ae0f00da06b1e574d29fe776b1589049a9eb3d6f8",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "13ba9cfbf44962fc0320ed4cdfaedf5bc8a339557d5ccee02c17701d09bdd8d3",
      "passageSha256": "5520749acde7c3fe55ce4a1cf160885e302b975085e1e56a465fc1a10279a49e",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0114",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Then, “What else do you see?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "b7949ff9d505fa83c74252e7450fe0788efe578b27254de6b7372c43306934bb",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-060",
      "parentFingerprint": "4689340cc49ebc5156a665ddfa4e05fe271802ea9f18e7cbf737c8dae305535a",
      "passageSha256": "753f6117c42d86a20688a7be9c078c9bd253d025d1d0538217fb8ed3da576d8c",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0115",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-s008",
      "sentenceText": "The first group of participants saw a series of figure-ground drawings one at a time and were asked to write about what they saw.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1262f56ac2be142c5ae558d261cb95b17b926825f77e795311bcb8b4821da204",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-060",
      "parentFingerprint": "4689340cc49ebc5156a665ddfa4e05fe271802ea9f18e7cbf737c8dae305535a",
      "passageSha256": "753f6117c42d86a20688a7be9c078c9bd253d025d1d0538217fb8ed3da576d8c",
      "pdfPages": [
        98
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0116",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-s009",
      "sentenceText": "The second group saw a series of slightly altered drawings—essentially the same images as the first group saw, but lacking the secondary object—and were asked to write about what they saw.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bb6f04a88b6dc54e4bdf7515ccc9530bd4f90c53f22531596c5537c9adefb1ac",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p098-05602-r009-010",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-061",
      "parentFingerprint": "a557c24a8b1585f19d90359150d5fb3734042d75f256f435e91e64b0748c3b31",
      "passageSha256": "ab869decacc7c18fec55b8d055bb36fc801f27eb67e00a9af7f74b6b4b6fa27f",
      "pdfPages": [
        98,
        99
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0117",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-s002",
      "sentenceText": "A subtle visual difference made a huge psychological difference between the two groups.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a016320d002010053ac713e18e01f6eacefb2e321dc7ac28919ad3da50a51e84",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "c86401eaf8c15fbfbeadfe94d6c7267a427b7dac395bfcd26b2a3a7c30498b83",
      "passageSha256": "8ac4e46fff16a2748654f29b975e19330ddf20d08b836e954047e88c22bf6ea8",
      "pdfPages": [
        99
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0118",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-s003",
      "sentenceText": "The figure-ground group saw multiple things in one drawing.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b459235b9d08e749b6efa82311766db8319d7ef6b1124b25deb26bb6f3202d9c",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "c86401eaf8c15fbfbeadfe94d6c7267a427b7dac395bfcd26b2a3a7c30498b83",
      "passageSha256": "8ac4e46fff16a2748654f29b975e19330ddf20d08b836e954047e88c22bf6ea8",
      "pdfPages": [
        99
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0119",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Perhaps they were puzzled at first, with some vague feeling that something was different.",
      "sentenceSha256": "15e738a33ae15687673b47790a3e0c1706441133e81827903dcbe60a608b82f1",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-062",
      "parentFingerprint": "c86401eaf8c15fbfbeadfe94d6c7267a427b7dac395bfcd26b2a3a7c30498b83",
      "passageSha256": "8ac4e46fff16a2748654f29b975e19330ddf20d08b836e954047e88c22bf6ea8",
      "pdfPages": [
        99
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0120",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-s005",
      "sentenceText": "That feeling then turned into a more certain identification of the secondary view.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2790ff4bf98b62b7083775ea0da7d5de393cc557f863d673699bd6183bc0c83d",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-063",
      "parentFingerprint": "4f213c751234bbd68acac3caaa502cfaaf41fd6d1f1d9e6b354ad1cd57030208",
      "passageSha256": "f7d1622e88edf5e531198df2c60efe0c95c9160372a0726296304fa9b9a494d7",
      "pdfPages": [
        99
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0121",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-s006",
      "sentenceText": "In contrast, the control group saw drawings that were singular, clear, and unambiguous.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9dc30cf82cb3d669ce6ed1c17f18928cdd38bf3234d1efdf8401f9ecfad3e095",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s04-p099-04830-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-063",
      "parentFingerprint": "4f213c751234bbd68acac3caaa502cfaaf41fd6d1f1d9e6b354ad1cd57030208",
      "passageSha256": "f7d1622e88edf5e531198df2c60efe0c95c9160372a0726296304fa9b9a494d7",
      "pdfPages": [
        99
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0122",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-s001",
      "sentenceText": "For some, sports are simply a pastime, what Kant called “games which bring with them no further interest than that of making the time pass imperceptibly.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "16cff032b55e147c04e59de601fa5ee8c0541c57de0560089204938f2ce27bd9",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-065",
      "parentFingerprint": "64cbcfe63f635497d1f68d43d794f92ebe6868588cde617b3b0138a272a82b34",
      "passageSha256": "3f8387d3609240bc1fdfe99f4dbdebf4f91b79d3b6f6056636a09ef10347ca24",
      "pdfPages": [
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0123",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-s002",
      "sentenceText": "For others, sports are more than just entertainment.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7fa176978cdb8ea4f4a90cd7be1481df8e6bc56c9f505284c9f5bd5ccbbc83ac",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-065",
      "parentFingerprint": "64cbcfe63f635497d1f68d43d794f92ebe6868588cde617b3b0138a272a82b34",
      "passageSha256": "3f8387d3609240bc1fdfe99f4dbdebf4f91b79d3b6f6056636a09ef10347ca24",
      "pdfPages": [
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0124",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-s005",
      "sentenceText": "When you think you’ve won the World Series, a star first baseman could miss a routine groundball, letting it go through his legs; the next thing you know, the other team has won the championship (this really happened, in 1986).",
      "sentenceSha256": "13235c5a569b1686a1eadf8440628ec878426225a7ddf3efa10572c55508c8ab",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-066",
      "parentFingerprint": "66c33614807e937da80617ed2a2bdfd9f3fbf1a896711dd9f4dc06bc82561e8d",
      "passageSha256": "1445c1aceb2ddba782f7889f0e8c0f12edc8c1adc3f558e9bc96a59a4b0db65e",
      "pdfPages": [
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0125",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Then there are impossible passes by Magic Johnson and improbable dunks by Michael Jordan and LeBron James at the least expected moments.",
      "sentenceSha256": "72b75824c26a17f692beadde8eb0186dc887a5750888fc9b8e6fdd8030995467",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-01650-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-066",
      "parentFingerprint": "66c33614807e937da80617ed2a2bdfd9f3fbf1a896711dd9f4dc06bc82561e8d",
      "passageSha256": "1445c1aceb2ddba782f7889f0e8c0f12edc8c1adc3f558e9bc96a59a4b0db65e",
      "pdfPages": [
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0126",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-04185-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Here is one of the dramatic turn of events that happened to my favorite team, the Houston Rockets, in 1995.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bf1b85660c9180a788ed259b4f4e4465bbd781b5974cfb6e1aecd198688c5f24",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-04185-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-068",
      "parentFingerprint": "eb48150b61afba9ca0f6586bb6418d40f21619021e507e9f3f53a1ffb97dee4d",
      "passageSha256": "83664af151c6807099bf67ed8893dbb8b1275a4723fdedb0fa77f5ef89f59836",
      "pdfPages": [
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0127",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-04185-s003",
      "sentenceText": "The Rockets won their first NBA championship during the 1993–1994 season, led by my favorite player, Hakeem Olajuwon.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b5b9261bb10437f1cdcb38136a37cc85f90b08a0ed2e1d7f3b90504de07be3ab",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-04185-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-068",
      "parentFingerprint": "eb48150b61afba9ca0f6586bb6418d40f21619021e507e9f3f53a1ffb97dee4d",
      "passageSha256": "83664af151c6807099bf67ed8893dbb8b1275a4723fdedb0fa77f5ef89f59836",
      "pdfPages": [
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0128",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s05-p100-05745-s001",
      "sentenceText": "But then their offense struggled.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd3471d18d0a42c1e439f29f2fc681cb671bf3c4d44d6226a174ee9d1f039526",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s05-p100-05745-r001-004",
